{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"The Count of Monte Cristo","description":"Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.\n\nEnded · First aired 13 Jan 2025 · France, Italy · Language: Italian\nStudio: Palomar, DEMD Productions, Rai Fiction · Network: Rai 1\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: English (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Action & Adventure","Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.1","title":"The Letter","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2025-01-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A 19-year-old sailor is falsely imprisoned for treason in the island fortress Château d'If near Marseille without trial. Escaping after many years in captivity and becoming the Count of Monte Cristo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gQ69sB4iBZpcbqZ725G8KEZA2Xw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.2","title":"The Castle","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2025-01-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edmond, imprisoned for ten years, meets Abbé Faria, a fellow inmate digging an escape tunnel, sparking a chance at freedom.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xPFW48wm5ULArL2ZKBfxjK2D5Kg.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.3","title":"The Treasure","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edmond arrives in Marseille and learns that his father has died, that Mercedes has married and moved to Paris. During his visit to Mrseille, he encounters a young Italian man named Jacopo with whom he escapes to Italy by boat. After an evening at Jacopo's home, Edmond borrows Jacopo's boat and navigates to the Island of Monte-Cristo in search of the lost treasure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sjVHxWRQ06Q9KMva46Zlf7NtBAE.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.4","title":"The Red Room","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Five years after Edmond becomes the Count of Monte Cristo, he meets his enemies in Paris. Edmond invites them all to dinner and tells a spooky story about a newborn baby buried alive, which horrifies several of his guests.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6EXFa7SsV9tUVMYQ4d3yOFuSs28.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.5","title":"The Ball","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-01-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edmond frees the slave Haydée, daughter of Ali Pascha, and takes her to Paris. At a ball, Haydée reveals that Fernand betrayed her father. Mercedes begins to suspect that there is something wrong with the count's identity.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rWkCzYmgeHkJhtKAbdk2uzsMNXW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.6","title":"Providence","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-01-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edmond introduces Vampa, now in the role of the wealthy Count of Spada, to society. Spada says he came to Paris to find a wife. Edmond convinces old Noirtier to reveal a secret.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fhoX4lfNNulazpyjklh1uyafRrj.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.7","title":"The Duel","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2025-02-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edmond finds Villefort's illegitimate son Gaston, who has become a thief. Danglars reveals Fernand's betrayal in Algeria, Fernand's son Albert becomes enraged and challenges Edmond to a duel.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cotAKEUyiWInHk078TyloQUjQ0r.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1Db3VudC1vZi1Nb250ZS1DcmlzdG8tJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.8","title":"The Last Two","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2025-02-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Edmond exposes Heloise's poisoning plot. Midwife testifies against father at Gaston's infanticide trial. Years later, Edmond reunites with Mercedes in Marseille, questioning ability to love again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vrUYdaDa4GtOg3WaBzfXs5Ys0Vp.jpg"}],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bH85johgKnXDVVHdta9Q0wnG2PI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aNFblOb9du8236un6o3qROVYDX4.jpg","imdbRating":"7.9","cast":["Sam Claflin","Ana Girardot","Blake Ritson","Mikkel Boe Følsgaard","Harry Taurasi","Michele Riondino","Jeremy Irons","Lino Guanciale"],"director":["Bille August"],"released":"2025-01-13T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Bille August","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cBau5curUxUfgj0H8o35OxOOS4F.jpg"},{"name":"Sam Claflin","character":"Edmond Dantès","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e5CU4tjCNZFfm7ITmZfzjZse2Bb.jpg"},{"name":"Ana Girardot","character":"Mercedes","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/axcopunXu4j6XHcm34YjBf0Ua19.jpg"},{"name":"Blake Ritson","character":"Danglars","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/61NhsA2UEjtQVm6IvRijrgZ0W4e.jpg"},{"name":"Mikkel Boe Følsgaard","character":"Gerard Villefort","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oKC5KLsbj0npfRJA3j9nEIMglmg.jpg"},{"name":"Harry Taurasi","character":"Fernand","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w